# workspaces/ IS tracked (owner directive 2026-08-07). The COC workspace —
# briefs, specs, analysis, todos, journals, validation reports — is durable
# project knowledge, and gitignoring it stranded every /sweep report and
# workspace journal as local-only.
# Secrets stay ignored: a workspace .env is a real credential surface, and
# `security.md` § "No .env in Git" is not lifted by tracking the directory.
/workspaces/**/.env
/workspaces/**/.env.*
!/workspaces/**/.env.example
!.claude/bin/lib/
!.claude/hooks/lib/
!.claude/test-harness/lib/
!.claude/audit-fixtures/**
